{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46175","headline":"避地毘陵寒月上孙徽使君兼寄东阳王使君三首 三 · 贯休","name":"避地毘陵寒月上孙徽使君兼寄东阳王使君三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"□雷车雨滴阶声，寂寞焚香独闭扃。\n锦绣文章无路达，袴襦歌咏隔墙听。\n松声冷浸茶轩碧，苔点狂吞纳线青。\n唯有孤高江太守，不忘病客在禅灵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46175.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46175","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}